option.GLOWING_ORE_GILDEDBLACKSTONE=Gilded Blackstone Glow
option.GLOWING_ORE_ANCIENTDEBRIS=Ancient Debris Glow
option.GLOWING_ORE_MODDED=Modded Ore Glow§e[*]§r
option.GLOWING_ORE_MODDED.comment=§e[*]§r You can add modded ore IDs in the block.properties file of the shader pack to make them glow. Open block.properties with any text editor and add modded ore block IDs next to "block.10024=".

option.GLOWING_AMETHYST=Amethyst Glow
value.GLOWING_AMETHYST.0=Off
value.GLOWING_AMETHYST.1=Crystal
value.GLOWING_AMETHYST.2=Crystal & Block

option.GLOWING_LICHEN=Glowing Lichen
value.GLOWING_LICHEN.0=Off
value.GLOWING_LICHEN.1=Enclosed Area
value.GLOWING_LICHEN.2=Always

option.EMISSIVE_REDSTONE_BLOCK=Redstone Block Glow

option.EMISSIVE_LAPIS_BLOCK=Lapis Lazuli Block Glow

option.GLOWING_ARMOR_TRIM=Armor Trim Glow§e[*]§r
option.GLOWING_ARMOR_TRIM.comment=Makes armor trims emissive. §e[*]§r Only effective on Iris; Optifine does not support armor trim detection.

option.NORMAL_MAP_STRENGTH=Normal Map Strength
option.NORMAL_MAP_STRENGTH.comment=Adjusts the strength of surface bump details. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.

option.CUSTOM_EMISSION_INTENSITY=Emissive Intensity
option.CUSTOM_EMISSION_INTENSITY.comment=Adjusts the intensity of emissive surfaces. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.

option.POM=§eParallax Mapping§r
option.POM.comment=Enables 3D effects on surfaces. §c[-]§r Will severely impact performance. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.
value.POM.false=Off
value.POM.true=On §c[-]

option.POM_DEPTH=Parallax Depth
option.POM_DEPTH.comment=Adjusts the depth of parallax mapping. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.

option.POM_QUALITY=§eParallax Quality§r
option.POM_QUALITY.comment=Adjusts the sharpness/accuracy of parallax mapping. §c[-]§r Above 200 will severely impact performance. §e[*]§r Below 100 forces parallax lighting mode to "Smooth". §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.
value.POM_QUALITY.16=16 §e[*]
value.POM_QUALITY.32=32 §e[*]
value.POM_QUALITY.64=64 §e[*]
value.POM_QUALITY.256=256 §c[-]
value.POM_QUALITY.512=512 §c[-]

option.POM_DISTANCE=§eParallax Distance§r
option.POM_DISTANCE.comment=Adjusts the calculation distance of parallax mapping. §e[*]§r Recommended to keep it below 50 for a slight performance improvement. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.
value.POM_DISTANCE.64=64 §e[*]
value.POM_DISTANCE.128=128 §e[*]
value.POM_DISTANCE.256=256 §e[*]
value.POM_DISTANCE.512=512 §e[*]
value.POM_DISTANCE.1024=1024 §e[*]

option.POM_LIGHTING_MODE=Parallax Lighting Mode
option.POM_LIGHTING_MODE.comment=Adjusts the lighting style of parallax-affected surfaces. Sharp: Parallax walls receive no light if not facing the light source. Smooth: Retains lighting even on parallax walls. §e[*]§r Forced to "Smooth" when parallax quality is below 100.
value.POM_LIGHTING_MODE.1=Smooth
value.POM_LIGHTING_MODE.2=Sharp

option.POM_ALLOW_CUTOUT=§eCutout POM§c[-]§r
option.POM_ALLOW_CUTOUT.comment=Allows parallax mapping to work on cutout block parts (e.g., between leaves). §c[-]§r Will severely impact performance.

option.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT=§eDirectional Block Light§r
option.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT.comment=Adds depth to block light based on surface normals. §c[-]§r May produce visual artifacts in some cases. §c[-]§r Will affect performance. §e[*]§r RP Support must be set to labPBR/seuspbr with a compatible resource pack.
value.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT.0=Off
value.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT.3=Light §c[-]
value.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT.7=Normal §c[-]
value.DIRECTIONAL_BLOCKLIGHT.11=Strong §c[-]

option.HELD_LIGHTING_MODE=Dynamic Held Light
option.HELD_LIGHTING_MODE.comment=Allows held light sources to illuminate the scene.
value.HELD_LIGHTING_MODE.0=Off
value.HELD_LIGHTING_MODE.1=Light
value.HELD_LIGHTING_MODE.2=Normal

option.BLOCKLIGHT_FLICKERING=Block Light Flickering
option.BLOCKLIGHT_FLICKERING.comment=Adds a flickering effect to light emitted by blocks.
value.BLOCKLIGHT_FLICKERING.0=Off

option.WAVING_SPEED=Waving Speed
option.WAVING_SPEED.comment=Adjusts the speed of waving effects.

option.WAVING_I=Waving Intensity
option.WAVING_I.comment=Adjusts the movement amplitude of waving blocks. §c[-]§r Excessive waving intensity may cause blocks to clip through other blocks.
value.WAVING_I.1.25=1.25 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.1.50=1.50 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.1.75=1.75 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.2.00=2.00 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.50.0=§cCrazy

option.NO_WAVING_INDOORS=No Waving Indoors
option.NO_WAVING_INDOORS.comment=Uses skylight to prevent block waving in enclosed areas. §c[-]§r May conflict with some resource packs or mods when enabled.

option.WAVING_I_RAIN_MULT=§eWaving Rain Multiplier§r
option.WAVING_I_RAIN_MULT.comment=Multiplies the speed and intensity of waving during rain. §c[-]§r Too high may cause blocks to clip. §c[-]§r Affects performance above 100.
value.WAVING_I.125=125 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.150=150 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.175=175 §c[-]
value.WAVING_I.200=200 §c[-]

option.WAVING_FOLIAGE=Grass Waving
option.WAVING_FOLIAGE.comment=Adds movement to grass and similar vegetation to simulate wind.

option.WAVING_LEAVES=Leaves Waving
option.WAVING_LEAVES.comment=Adds movement to leaves to simulate wind.

option.WAVING_LAVA=Lava Texture Waving
option.WAVING_LAVA.comment=Adds continuous movement to lava. §e[*]§r Lava waving is not affected by the "No Waving Indoors" setting.

option.WAVING_LILY_PAD=Lily Pad Waving§c[-]§r
option.WAVING_LILY_PAD.comment=Adds movement to lily pads and frogspawn to simulate water ripple impact. §c[-]§r Will cause lily pads on waterlogged blocks to become invisible.

option.WAVING_WATER_VERTEX=Water Surface Waving Height
option.WAVING_WATER_VERTEX.comment=Adds movement to the water surface position to simulate wind. §e[*]§r This option is independent of the "Wave Intensity" setting.

option.WAVING_RAIN=Rain/Snow Texture Waving
option.WAVING_RAIN.comment=Adds movement to falling rain/snow textures to make them more dynamic.

option.SPECIAL_PORTAL_EFFECTS=Portal Effects
option.SPECIAL_PORTAL_EFFECTS.comment=Adds special animations and emissive effects to Nether portals, End portals, and End gateways.

option.REFLECTION_RES=§eReflection Resolution§r
option.REFLECTION_RES.comment=Changes the resolution of PBR reflections on blocks (and world space reflections) for performance gains. §c[-]§r "Full" resolution reflections severely impact performance in some cases. §e[*]§r Not effective on Optifine.
value.REFLECTION_RES.1.0=§4§l§n§oFull
value.REFLECTION_RES.0.5=§aHalf

option.WORLD_OUTLINE=§eWorld Outline§r
option.WORLD_OUTLINE.comment=Adds a bright outline around blocks. §c[-]§r Will affect performance.

option.WORLD_OUTLINE_THICKNESS=§eWorld Outline Thickness§r
option.WORLD_OUTLINE_THICKNESS.comment=Determines the thickness of the world outline effect. §c[-]§r Increasing will affect performance.

option.WORLD_OUTLINE_I=World Outline Brightness
option.WORLD_OUTLINE_I.comment=Determines the intensity of the world outline effect.

option.WORLD_OUTLINE_ON_ENTITIES=Entity World Outline
option.WORLD_OUTLINE_ON_ENTITIES.comment=Determines whether the world outline is applied to entities. §c[-]§r May not be fully compatible with some custom PBR resource packs.

option.WORLD_OUTLINE_SCALED=Distance Scaled Outline
option.WORLD_OUTLINE_SCALED.comment=Scales the world outline size with distance.

option.DARK_OUTLINE=§eDark Outline§r
option.DARK_OUTLINE.comment=Adds a dark outline around blocks. §c[-]§r Will affect performance.

option.DARK_OUTLINE_THICKNESS=§eDark Outline Thickness§r
option.DARK_OUTLINE_THICKNESS.comment=Determines the thickness of the dark outline effect. §c[-]§r Increasing will affect performance.

option.RAIN_PUDDLES=§eRain Puddles§r
option.RAIN_PUDDLES.comment=Adds puddles on surfaces during rain. §c[-]§r Will severely impact performance.
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.0=§aOff
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.1=§cRain Puddles
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.2=§cRain Full Coverage
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.3=§cPermanent Puddles
value.RAIN_PUDDLES.4=§cPermanent Full Coverage

option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION=Underwater Distortion
option.UNDERWATER_DISTORTION.comment=Adds a subtle refraction effect when the camera is underwater.

option.SELECT_OUTLINE=Selection Outline
option.SELECT_OUTLINE.comment=Determines the color of the block selection outline.
value.SELECT_OUTLINE.0=Off
value.SELECT_OUTLINE.1=Default
value.SELECT_OUTLINE.2=Rainbow
value.SELECT_OUTLINE.3=Select Color
value.SELECT_OUTLINE.4=Universal

option.SELECT_OUTLINE_AUTO_HIDE=Auto-Hide Selection Outline
option.SELECT_OUTLINE_AUTO_HIDE.comment=Hides the block selection outline when the player's main hand is empty.

option.SELECT_OUTLINE_I=Outline Brightness
option.SELECT_OUTLINE_R=SO Red
option.SELECT_OUTLINE_G=SO Green
option.SELECT_OUTLINE_B=SO Blue

option.MOON_PHASE_INF_LIGHT=Moon Phase Night Light
option.MOON_PHASE_INF_LIGHT.comment=Enables different moon phases to change nighttime lighting brightness.

option.MOON_PHASE_INF_ATMOSPHERE=Moon Phase Night Atmosphere
option.MOON_PHASE_INF_ATMOSPHERE.comment=Enables different moon phases to change nighttime atmosphere brightness.

option.MOON_PHASE_INF_REFLECTION=Moon Phase Moon Reflection
option.MOON_PHASE_INF_REFLECTION.comment=Enables different moon phases to change the brightness of moon reflections.

option.MOON_PHASE_FULL=Full Moon Intensity
option.MOON_PHASE_FULL.comment=Adjusts the moon phase influence during a full moon (brightest phase).

option.MOON_PHASE_PARTIAL=Partial Moon Intensity
option.MOON_PHASE_PARTIAL.comment=Adjusts the moon phase influence for all phases between full and dark moon. This is the most commonly seen phase in Minecraft.

option.MOON_PHASE_DARK=Dark Moon Intensity
option.MOON_PHASE_DARK.comment=Adjusts the moon phase influence during a new moon (darkest phase).

option.CONNECTED_GLASS_EFFECT=Connected Glass
option.CONNECTED_GLASS_EFFECT.comment=Makes all types of glass connect to each other. §e[*]§r Only effective when Advanced Color Tracking is enabled and the system supports it. §e[*]§r Automatically disabled when the Continuity mod is installed.

option.PORTAL_EDGE_EFFECT=Glowing Portal Frame
option.PORTAL_EDGE_EFFECT.comment=Adds an emissive border to End and Nether portals. §e[*]§r Only effective when Advanced Color Tracking is enabled and the system supports it.

option.PUDDLE_VOXELIZATION=Fix Puddles Under Glass
option.PUDDLE_VOXELIZATION.comment=Prevents rain puddles from forming under glass-roofed enclosed areas when the puddle effect is enabled. §e[*]§r Only effective when Advanced Color Tracking is enabled and Detail Quality is set to High or above.

option.COLORED_CANDLE_LIGHT=Colored Candle Light
option.COLORED_CANDLE_LIGHT.comment=Makes the light emitted by candles match their base color. §e[*]§r Desaturated candle variants continue to use the usual flame color.

option.COLORED_LIGHT_SATURATION=Colored Light Saturation
option.COLORED_LIGHT_SATURATION.comment=Adjusts the color saturation produced by Advanced Color Tracking. §e[*]§r Not recommended to change this value; the visual effect is designed to be most balanced at default saturation.

option.COLORED_LIGHT_FOG=§eColored Light Fog§r
option.COLORED_LIGHT_FOG.comment=Adds volumetric block light fog to the scene, most noticeable at night or underground. §e[*]§r Only effective when Advanced Color Tracking is enabled and the system supports it. §c[-]§r Will severely impact performance.

option.COLORED_LIGHT_FOG_I=Light Fog Intensity
option.COLORED_LIGHT_FOG_I.comment=Determines the brightness of the colored light fog.

option.LIGHT_COLOR_MULTS=§eLight Color Multipliers
option.LIGHT_COLOR_MULTS.comment=Enables customization of light colors visible on all surfaces.

option.ATM_COLOR_MULTS=§eAtmosphere Color Multipliers
option.ATM_COLOR_MULTS.comment=Enables customization of atmosphere colors primarily visible in the sky and fog.

